{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "a8f3b210-91cd-4e89-b827-loanappplatform",
		"name": "Loan Application Platform API",
		"description": "# Loan Application Platform API - QA Testing Collection\n\n## How Token Management Works (Zero Copy-Paste!)\n\n1. **Login as any user** → the token is automatically saved to `{{bearer_token}}` AND cached per-role (e.g. `{{token_t1_applicant}}`)\n2. **All protected requests use `{{bearer_token}}`** → they automatically pick up whichever user you last logged in as\n3. **Switch roles instantly** → use the \"⚡ Switch to [role]\" requests in the Quick Role Switch folder — no need to re-login!\n4. **The active user is tracked** → check `{{active_user}}` to see who you're logged in as\n\n## Recommended E2E Test Flow\n\n1. Hit '🔄 Login All Users (Batch)' to cache all tokens at once\n2. Switch to `t1_admin` → Deposit to Treasury\n3. Switch to `t1_applicant` → Create Loan Application (ID auto-saved)\n4. Switch to `t1_reviewer` → Review Application\n5. Switch to `t1_approver` → Approve Application\n6. Switch to `t1_admin` → Release Loan Funds\n7. Switch to `t1_applicant` → View Payment Schedules → Submit Payment\n8. Switch to `t1_admin` → Post Verified Payment\n\n## Test Assertions\nEvery request includes automated test scripts that validate:\n- Expected HTTP status codes\n- Response body structure\n- Dynamic ID extraction for downstream requests",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{bearer_token}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"event": [
		{
			"listen": "prerequest",
			"script": {
				"type": "text/javascript",
				"exec": [
					"// Collection-level pre-request: warn if no token is set for protected endpoints",
					"const noAuthPaths = ['/api/authentication/login', '/api/authentication/register'];",
					"const currentUrl = pm.request.url.toString().toLowerCase();",
					"const isPublic = noAuthPaths.some(p => currentUrl.includes(p));",
					"",
					"if (!isPublic && !pm.environment.get('bearer_token')) {",
					"    console.warn('⚠️ No bearer_token set! Please login first using one of the Authentication requests.');",
					"}"
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"listen": "test",
			"script": {
				"type": "text/javascript",
				"exec": [
					"// Collection-level test: log response time for all requests",
					"pm.test('Response time is acceptable (< 5s)', function () {",
					"    pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(5000);",
					"});",
					"",
					"// Log active user for debugging",
					"const activeUser = pm.environment.get('active_user');",
					"if (activeUser) {",
					"    console.log('🔑 Active user: ' + activeUser);",
					"}"
				]
			}
		}
	],
